Store Credit-Card information
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/cc_storage/store
Request
Body

application/json

sid
string
Session ID

client_id
integer
Client ID

custom_client_id
string
Custom Client ID (from external system)

vat_id
number
Client VAT ID

email
string
Client email

client_name
string
Client name

cc_number
number
required
Credit-Card number

cc_type
string
Credit-Card type

cc_cvv
number
CVV - Card Verification number (3 or 4 digits on the back of the card)

cc_validity
number
required
Card validity month in either YYYY-MM or MMYY format

cc_holder_id
number
Card holder ID number

cc_holder_name
string
Card holder name

die_if_exists
boolean
Return error if token already exists

Responses
200
OK

